This code defines a C function `initialize_arrays` which dynamically allocates memory for and initializes arrays of doubles, chars, and pointers to `struct item`. It reads configuration from a JSON file `/config/settings.json`, handling memory allocation failures gracefully. The JSON parsing is done using the cJSON library, and unique strings are generated from a predefined pool of keywords to populate `struct item` instances.']

